message.field:
Supported sub-options; interpretation depends on ability_category:
DOG_ABILITY_CATEGORY_ACTION_CONTROL: CUSTOM_DOG_ACTION_OP;
DOG_ABILITY_CATEGORY_GAIT_SWITCH: CUSTOM_DOG_GAIT_TYPE;
DOG_ABILITY_CATEGORY_USAGE_MODE_SWITCH: CUSTOM_DOG_USAGE_MODE;
DOG_ABILITY_CATEGORY_AUTHORITY: CUSTOM_DOG_AUTHORITY_OP;
DOG_ABILITY_CATEGORY_SEARCH_LIGHT: CUSTOM_DOG_SEARCH_LIGHT_OP;
DOG_ABILITY_CATEGORY_EMERGENCY_STOP and others without sub-options: 0.
